   175	- `body-mutation.py`: operational-sensitivity witness.  The changed initial
   176	  word makes `anti_shuffle("")` return `"x"`; the fixed-semantics assertion
   177	  fails with `AssertionError` and modeled exit code `1`.
   178	- `spec-vacuity.k`: false-postcondition probe.  The command in `prove.sh` exits
   179	  nonzero with `WarnStuckClaimState`; the residual visibly compares the actual
   180	  result with the impossible code-`0` prefix.
   181	
   182	Finite tests support the trusted sort contract and model adequacy; they are not
   183	claimed as a universal proof.  Excluded behavior is non-string input, external
   184	state not present in the reference semantics, and an independent termination
   185	theorem.  The universal K result remains conditional on the supplied semantics
